<% layout('layouts/base') %>

<section>
  <h1>About</h1>
  
  <p>Hi, I'm Tom. Welcome to my corner of the internet.</p>
  
  <h2>What You'll Find Here</h2>
  <p>This blog covers my thoughts and experiences with:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Software development and architecture</li>
    <li>Web technologies and frameworks</li>
    <li>Technology trends and industry insights</li>
    <li>Personal projects and experiments</li>
    <li>Occasional thoughts on life and work</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h2>Technical Details</h2>
  <p>This site is built with:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>TypeScript</strong> for type safety and developer experience</li>
    <li><strong>Koa.js</strong> for the server framework</li>
    <li><strong>Eta</strong> for templating</li>
    <li><strong>Pico CSS</strong> for styling</li>
    <li><strong>Static-first SPA</strong> architecture for performance</li>
  </ul>
  
  <p>The source code is available on <a href="https://github.com/tlef/tlef.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.</p>
  
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>You can find me on <a href="https://github.com/tlef" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a> or reach out via email.</p>
  
  <p><a href="/" data-spa-link>← Back to home</a></p>
</section>
